{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_e9480e5d2a904b27-1062\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>肥媽在《今個夏天食平D》節目中，打造了一款帶有冰凍感覺、兼具新意與口感的「抹茶紅豆水晶月餅」！這款月餅外觀晶瑩剔透，口感像果凍般充滿彈性，搭配清香抹茶與香甜紅豆，絕對是中秋必試的創新甜品！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e9480e5d2a904b27-1062\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"03423112-e138-4d61-b3d8-297a1bcbd422.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OliU5WdkV91790070211.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"03423112-e138-4d61-b3d8-297a1bcbd422.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_e9480e5d2a904b27-1062\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>抹茶紅豆水晶月餅 食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-